# The announcement store is written by news_store.py on Windows today and by a
# GitHub Actions runner (Linux) once the ingest is scheduled. Without this, the
# two platforms would disagree about line endings and every ingest would rewrite
# whole month files -- turning "three new announcements" into a diff of several
# thousand changed lines, which is the same as having no review at all.
#
# news_store.py already writes newline="\n" explicitly; this keeps checkout from
# undoing that.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
